A '''Blue Jay''' is a [[Critter]] that can be found high up on {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}, often on trees within the {{Zone|Torrhus Heights}} or {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Blue Jays''' high up on {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}, often on trees within the {{Zone|Torrhus Heights}} or {{Zone|Torrhus Springs}}. They can occasionally be found in groups.

== Behavior ==
'''Blue Jays''' idle on the canopy of [[Helix Tree]]s or by their bases, provided they are not under a [[Tree Protection Order]]. <br>
Upon standing within about a {{green|dozen blocks}} of a '''Blue Jay''', a '''{{mctxt|c|/!\}}''' appears on its name tag.
* At this point, if the player idles for {{green|1 second}}, then an invisible countdown begins:
**After {{green|6}} seconds, the alert turns yellow '''{{mctxt|e|/!\}}''' ;
**After {{green|10}} seconds, the alert disappears and the player can cast their [[Lasso]].
* If at any point during the countdown, any nearby player moves or the tree is felled, the '''Blue Jay''' will flee to another tree.

